1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,453
The reveal films themselves became objects of study.

2
00:00:03,453 --> 00:00:14,007
Each member performed alone in a plain studio — one take, one lighting rig, no styling theatrics — because Y-G was selling raw material, not packaging.

3
00:00:14,007 --> 00:00:17,809
The comment sections turned into scouting combine reports.

4
00:00:17,809 --> 00:00:29,033
Tone, breath control, stage instinct, star presence, scored frame by frame by an audience that had been trained by a decade of survival shows to know exactly what it was looking at.

